#: adjustlevels.cpp:91 imageplugin_adjustlevels.cpp:63
msgid "Adjust Color Levels"
msgstr "Toonrebeden topassen"

#: adjustlevels.cpp:93
msgid "An image-histogram-levels adjustment plugin for digiKam."
msgstr "En digiKam-Moduul för't Topassen vun Klöörkanaal-Toonrebeden"

#: adjustlevels.cpp:99
msgid "Author and maintainer"
msgstr "Autor un Pleger"

#: adjustlevels.cpp:107
msgid ""
"<p>Here you can see the image's level-adjustments preview. You can pick color "
"on image to see the color level corresponding on histogram."
msgstr ""

#: adjustlevels.cpp:117
msgid "Channel:"
msgstr "Kanaal:"

#: adjustlevels.cpp:120 adjustlevels.cpp:125
msgid "Luminosity"
msgstr "Bildhelligkeit"

#: adjustlevels.cpp:121
msgid "Red"
msgstr "Root"

#: adjustlevels.cpp:122
msgid "Green"
msgstr "Gröön"

#: adjustlevels.cpp:123
msgid "Blue"
msgstr "Blaag"

#: adjustlevels.cpp:124
msgid "Alpha"
msgstr "Alpha"

#: adjustlevels.cpp:126
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>Select here the histogram channel to display:"
"<p><b>Luminosity</b>: display the image's luminosity values."
"<p><b>Red</b>: display the red image-channel values."
"<p><b>Green</b>: display the green image-channel values."
"<p><b>Blue</b>: display the blue image-channel values."
"<p><b>Alpha</b>: display the alpha image-channel values. This channel "
"corresponds to the transparency value and is supported by some image formats, "
"such as PNG or TIF."
msgstr ""
"<p>Hier kannst Du den Histogramm-Kanaal utsöken, den Du wiest hebben wullt:"
"<p><b>Bildhelligkeit</b>: wiest de Bildhelligkeit-Weerten vun dat Bild."
"<p><b>Root</b>: wiest de Rootkanaal-Weerten vun dat Bild."
"<p><b>Gröön</b>: wiest de Gröönkanaal-Weerten vun dat Bild."
"<p><b>Blaag</b>: wiest de Blaagkanaal-Weerten vun dat Bild."
"<p><b>Alpha</b>: wiest de Alphakanaal-Weerten vun dat Bild. Dit is de "
"Transparenz-Weert un warrt vun en Reeg vun Bildformaten as t.B. \"PNG\" oder "
"\"GIF\" ünnerstütt."

#: adjustlevels.cpp:139
msgid ""
"<p>Select here the histogram scale."
"<p>If the image's maximal counts are small, you can use the linear scale."
"<p>Logarithmic scale can be used when the maximal counts are big; if it is "
"used, all values (small and large) will be visible on the graph."
msgstr ""
"<p>Hier kannst Du de Histogramm-Skala utsöken."
"<p>Wenn de Hööchstweert vun dat Bild siet is, kannst Du de lineare Skala "
"bruken."
"<p>De logaritmisch Skala lett sik bi grote Hööchstweerten bruken. So warrt all "
"Weerten (siete un hoge) in de Grafik wiest."

#: adjustlevels.cpp:145
msgid "<p>Linear"
msgstr "<p>Lineaar"

#: adjustlevels.cpp:153
msgid "<p>Logarithmic"
msgstr "<p>Logaritmisch"

#: adjustlevels.cpp:171
msgid ""
"<p>Here you can see the target preview image histogram drawing of the selected "
"image channel. This one is re-computed at any levels settings changes."
msgstr ""

#: adjustlevels.cpp:181
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>This is the histogram drawing of the selected channel from original image"
msgstr "<p>Dit is dat Histogramm vun den utsöchten Bildkanaal"

#: adjustlevels.cpp:190 adjustlevels.cpp:206
msgid "<p>Select here the minimal intensity input value of the histogram."
msgstr ""
"<p>Hier kannst Du den sietsten Ingaav-Toonweert vun't Histogramm utsöken."

#: adjustlevels.cpp:191 adjustlevels.cpp:207
msgid "Minimal intensity input."
msgstr "Sietst Ingaav-Toonweert"

#: adjustlevels.cpp:199 adjustlevels.cpp:217
msgid "<p>Select here the maximal intensity input value of the histogram."
msgstr ""
"<p>Hier kannst Du den hööchsten Ingaav-Toonweert vun't Histogramm utsöken"

#: adjustlevels.cpp:200 adjustlevels.cpp:216
msgid "Maximal intensity input."
msgstr "Hööchst Ingaav-Toonweert"

#: adjustlevels.cpp:212
msgid "Gamma input value."
msgstr "Gamma-Ingaavweert"

#: adjustlevels.cpp:213
msgid "<p>Select here the gamma input value."
msgstr "<p>Hier kannst Du den Gamma-Ingaavweert utsöken."

#: adjustlevels.cpp:224 adjustlevels.cpp:243
msgid "<p>Select here the minimal intensity output value of the histogram."
msgstr ""
"<p>Hier kannst Du den sietsten Utgaav-Toonweert vun't Histogramm utsöken."

#: adjustlevels.cpp:225 adjustlevels.cpp:242
msgid "Minimal intensity output."
msgstr "Sietst Utgaav-Toonweert"

#: adjustlevels.cpp:233 adjustlevels.cpp:247
msgid "<p>Select here the maximal intensity output value of the histogram."
msgstr ""
"<p>Hier kannst Du den hööchsten Utgaav-Toonweert vun't Histogramm utsöken."

#: adjustlevels.cpp:234 adjustlevels.cpp:246
msgid "Maximal intensity output."
msgstr "Hööchst Utgaav-Toonweert"

#: adjustlevels.cpp:261
msgid "All channels shadow tone color picker"
msgstr "Schaddentoon-Klöörutwahl"

#: adjustlevels.cpp:262
msgid ""
"<p>With this button, you can pick the color from original image used to set <b>"
"Shadow Tone</b> levels input on Red, Green, Blue, and Luminosity channels."
msgstr ""
"<p>Mit dissen Knoop kannst Du de Klöör ut dat Orginaalbild utsöken, de Du för't "
"Fastleggen vun den <b>Schaddentoon</b> för den roden, grönen, blagen un den "
"Helligkeit-Kanaal bruken wullt."

#: adjustlevels.cpp:271
msgid "All channels middle tone color picker"
msgstr "Middeltoon-Klöörutwahl"

#: adjustlevels.cpp:272
msgid ""
"<p>With this button, you can pick the color from original image used to set <b>"
"Middle Tone</b> levels input on Red, Green, Blue, and Luminosity channels."
msgstr ""
"<p>Mit dissen Knoop kannst Du de Klöör ut dat Orginaalbild utsöken, de Du för't "
"Fastleggen vun den <b>Middeltoon</b> för den roden, grönen, blagen un den "
"Helligkeit-Kanaal bruken wullt."

#: adjustlevels.cpp:281
msgid "All channels highlight tone color picker"
msgstr "Gleemlicht-Klöörutwahl"

#: adjustlevels.cpp:282
msgid ""
"<p>With this button, you can pick the color from original image used to set <b>"
"Highlight Tone</b> levels input on Red, Green, Blue, and Luminosity channels."
msgstr ""
"<p>Mit dissen Knoop kannst Du de Klöör ut dat Orginaalbild utsöken, de Du för't "
"Fastleggen vun den <b>Gleemlichttoon</b> för den roden, grönen, blagen un den "
"Helligkeit-Kanaal bruken wullt."

#: adjustlevels.cpp:289
#, fuzzy
msgid "Adjust all levels automatically."
msgstr "<p>All Toonweerten automaatsch topassen"

#: adjustlevels.cpp:290
msgid ""
"<p>If you press this button, all channel levels will be adjusted automatically."
msgstr ""

#: adjustlevels.cpp:293
msgid "&Reset"
msgstr "&Torüchsetten"

#: adjustlevels.cpp:295
msgid "Reset current channel levels' values."
msgstr ""

#: adjustlevels.cpp:296
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>If you press this button, all levels' values from the current selected "
"channel will be reset to the default values."
msgstr "<p>Toonweerten vun den opstunns utsöchten Kanaal torüchsetten"

#: adjustlevels.cpp:310
msgid "Over exposure indicator"
msgstr "Överbelichten wiesen"

#: adjustlevels.cpp:311
msgid ""
"<p>If you enable this option, over-exposed pixels from the target image preview "
"will be over-colored. This will not have an effect on the final rendering."
msgstr ""
"<p>Wenn Du disse Optschoon anmaakst, warrt överbelicht Pixels in de "
"Teelbild-Vöransicht överteekt. Dit warkt sik nich op de Enn-Dorstellen ut."

#: adjustlevels.cpp:600
msgid "Adjust Level"
msgstr "Klöörrebeden topassen"

#: adjustlevels.cpp:696
msgid "Select Gimp Levels File to Load"
msgstr "Gimp-Klöörrebedendatei för't Laden utsöken"

#: adjustlevels.cpp:702
msgid "Cannot load from the Gimp levels text file."
msgstr "Gimp-Textdatei mit Klörrebeden lett sik nich laden."

#: adjustlevels.cpp:717
msgid "Gimp Levels File to Save"
msgstr "Gimp-Klöörrebendatei för't Sekern"

#: adjustlevels.cpp:723
msgid "Cannot save to the Gimp levels text file."
msgstr "Gimp-Textdatei mit Klöörrebeden lett sik nich sekern."

#: imageplugin_adjustlevels.cpp:43
msgid "Levels Adjust..."
msgstr "Klöörrebeden topassen..."

